**Claude Code**

```sh
claude plugin marketplace add acme/skills
claude plugin install alpha@acme
```

**Codex**

```sh
codex plugin marketplace add acme/skills
codex plugin add alpha@acme
```

**Plain skills folder** (from a clone of this repo)

```sh
./mb export skills ~/.agents/skills    # Codex
./mb export skills ~/.claude/skills    # Claude Code
```
